<title>USA: Investor lifts stake in Arnold Palmer Golf.</title>
<headline>Investor lifts stake in Arnold Palmer Golf.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>John Lupton, chairman and chief executive officer of Arnold Palmer Golf Co, said Tuesday he raised his stake in the company to 2,233,272 shares or 49.1 percent of the outstanding.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Lufton said he bought 833,333 preferred shares on August 21 for a total $5 million.</p>
<p>Lupton said he holds the stake for investment purposes.</p>
</text>
